Package: RomicsProcessor
Type: Package
Title: omics-oriented package for reproducible and sharable data
        processing pipelines
Version: 1.11.0
Author: @GeremyClair
Maintainer: The package maintainer <geremy.clair@pnnl.gov>
Description: This package enables processing omics datasets using an object type called romics_object, enabling FAIR-compatible science. The romics_object contains all the details to reprocess the data identically and to create processing pipelines.
